Id: perm022w
Severity: WARN
Category: filesystem
Check: check_perms
Fix: chown root the disk device.
References: chown(1)
Controls: CIS 3.3, 4.1; NIST AC-3, CM-6; ISO 8.3, 8.9; CE Secure configuration

The indicated disk device file is not owned by `root'.  This allows the
owner of the disk device to bypass the systems file access controls.
The owner should be changed to `root'.
